        "created_at": "2021-07-23T00:54:19.218Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’ve read the book a few times, but I don’t think I recall seeing a section on chases! Now, that doesn’t mean it isn’t there. But if I wanted to reenact, say, the chase scene from the Marvel Spider-Man video game where he has to swing chase a tank or the part where Captain America, Winter Soldier and Black Panther are all chasing each other in Civil War, I don’t exactly know how. I could probably knock together a. sort of…chase environment, I guess, but that doesn’t feel quite right. Has anyone put together rules for something like this? Or tell me where in the book I missed them because I’m foolish?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-07-23T00:54:19.218Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
