        "cooked": "<p>I don’t remember anything specifically in the rule book, but Adam and Paul planned out a chase scene during the Season 2 GM Prep (<a href=\"https://youtu.be/gO8b_z20MqA\">Chase prep starts around 36 minutes</a> ), and you can use that for inspiration.</p>",
